Camera: Bold7 Camera 3.6-bold7.1, my fork of BenOS Camera 3.6 by Rudi Timmermans, GNU General
Public License v3.0, modified
Source: https://github.com/codexofc/bold7-camera (commit 8939faaf83900b40149e3a7baffc19f30802aec8),
forked from https://github.com/ruditimmermans/BenOSCamera (tag v3.6, commit 3f0d633d)
  What I changed is in the fork's NOTICE: package dev.bold7.camera.benos, focus before each photo
  and at a touch, a square 720x720 viewfinder stream, the system bars hidden, no update check (no
  network at all), ZXing (Apache 2.0) instead of Google's ML Kit for QR codes. Built from that
  commit and signed with Bold7's key, shipped inside the module zip (apps/dev.bold7.camera.benos.apk,
  sha256 checked by the build) and installed by the module unless the user installed it. It is a
  separate program: Bold7 does not link to it, it only starts it. The archive of its sources at
  that commit (bold7-camera-3.6-bold7.1-src.tar.gz) is attached to each release of Bold7.

